This repository is a modified version of OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The upstream base is
commit 583ec348cf9007361d09513c716549c41d4d8128.

ProContract adds the progress-contract kernel and store (codex-rs/pro-contract,
codex-rs/pro-contract-store), the native extension (codex-rs/ext/pro-contract), and the
launcher, harness, research runtime and strategies under scripts/, harness/ and strategies/.
It also changes 79 files of the upstream project to integrate them; these files are listed
in docs/PROCONTRACT_UPSTREAM_CHANGES.md. All additions and changes are distributed under the
same license.
